   "titulo": "Four verbs and one infinitive",
   "texto": [
    "The four are followed by a verb in infinitive, as in Spanish: **Posso ir** (I can go), **quero ir** (I want to go), **tenho de ir** (I have to go), **sei nadar** (I can swim).",
    "«Have to» is **ter de**: **Tenho de trabalhar**."
